  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Circuit and analysis"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "A resistor $R_B$ is connected from $V_{CC}$ to the base, and $R_C$ from $V_{CC}$ to the collector. Base loop: $V_{CC} = I_B R_B + V_{BE}$, so $I_B = (V_{CC} - V_{BE})/R_B$, which is *fixed* by $R_B$. Then $I_C = \\beta I_B$ and the collector loop gives $V_{CE} = V_{CC} - I_C R_C$."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "I_B = (V_CC − V_BE)/R_B"
    },
    {
     "en": "I_C = β I_B"
    },
    {
     "en": "V_CE = V_CC − I_C R_C"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "In fixed bias the base current is set by R B alone. Collector current is beta times that, and V C E is V C C minus I C R C.",
    "kn": "ಸ್ಥಿರ ಬಯಾಸ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿ ಬೇಸ್ ಪ್ರವಾಹವನ್ನು Rb ಮಾತ್ರ ನಿರ್ಧರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ಕಲೆಕ್ಟರ್ ಪ್ರವಾಹ ಅದರ ಬೀಟಾ ಪಟ್ಟು, ಮತ್ತು Vce = Vcc − Ic Rc."
   },
   "formula": "I_B = \\frac{V_{CC}-V_{BE}}{R_B},\\qquad V_{CE} = V_{CC} - \\beta I_B R_C",
   "reveal": true,
   "voice": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "In fixed bias the base current is set by R B alone. Collector current is beta times that, and V C E is V C C minus I C R C. I B equals (V CC - V BE)/R B.",
      "kn": "ಸ್ಥಿರ ಬಯಾಸ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿ ಬೇಸ್ ಪ್ರವಾಹವನ್ನು Rb ಮಾತ್ರ ನಿರ್ಧರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ಕಲೆಕ್ಟರ್ ಪ್ರವಾಹ ಅದರ ಬೀಟಾ ಪಟ್ಟು, ಮತ್ತು Vce equals Vcc - Ic Rc."
     }
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "I C equals beta I B."
     }
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "V CE equals V CC - I C R C."
     }
    }
   ]
  },
