   "body": {
    "en": "*Merits*: very simple, few components, and the operating point can be set anywhere in the active region by choosing $R_B$. Demerits: there is no feedback, so $I_C$ follows every change in $\\beta$ and $I_{CO}$. Its stability factor is $S = 1+\\beta$, the worst of all bias circuits, so it is rarely used in practical amplifiers."
   },
   "points": [
